      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "LTX-2.3 V2V AnimateDiff Cleanup — 8GB (RTX 2070 SUPER)\n\n=== PURPOSE ===\nRe-detail and clean up ~15s AnimateDiff renders (24fps, 1080p source).\nRemove undescribable detail, fix blur, smooth jittery motion.\n\n=== VRAM ===\nTarget: 8GB local GPU\nLoader: UnetLoaderGGUF (Q4 quantized, distilled baked in)\nText encoder: CPU offload (device=cpu)\nTiled VAE encode + 2x2 decode tiles\nSeedVR2: 3B fp8 model, BlockSwap=16, CPU offload, tiled VAE\n\n=== IC-LORA STACK ===\n1. iclora_deblur (strength 0.6) — sharpen out-of-focus / blurry video [GATED]\n2. omninft_rl_lora (strength 2.0) — general quality boost\n\n=== BYPASSABLE STAGES ===\nRight-click → Bypass on any stage to skip it:\n\nStage C: SeedVR2 Upscale (nodes 30-32)\n  ON:  512x288 → 1080p (SeedVR2 reconstructs detail + color correction)\n  OFF: 512x288 output directly (fast preview)\n\n=== OUTPUT MODES ===\nPreview:  bypass C → 512x288 @ 24fps\n1080p:   C on      → 1920x1080 @ 24fps (SeedVR2 target resolution=1080)\n\n=== SEEDVR2 PARAMETERS ===\nModel: seedvr2_ema_3b_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors (3B, fp8)\nVAE: ema_vae_fp16.safetensors (tiled, 512px tiles)\nBlockSwap: 16 blocks to CPU (fits 8GB)\nbatch_size: 5 (4n+1 pattern for temporal coherence)\ntemporal_overlap: 2 (blend between batches)\ncolor_correction: lab (perceptual color matching)\nresolution: 1080 (target shortest edge)\n\n=== GATED LORAS ===\niclora_deblur requires HF_TOKEN:\n1. Visit https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-IC-LoRA-Deblur\n2. Click 'Agree and Access'\n3. export HF_TOKEN=hf_...\n4. ./scripts/install_ltx23.sh --profile low_vram_8gb\n\n=== SEEDVR2 MODELS ===\nAuto-download on first use to models/seedvr2/.\n3B fp8 DiT (~6GB) + fp16 VAE (~500MB).\nFor RunPod: pre-download to network volume.\n\n=== BRAVE VARIANT ===\nSet resolution=2160 for 4K output (may be slow on 8GB).\nOr increase batch_size to 9 for better temporal coherence (needs more VRAM)."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
